                <mxCell id="card_fsm" value="&lt;b&gt;Moore FSM Model:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Outputs = $\lambda(S)$&lt;br/&gt;  Strictly state-dependent.&lt;br/&gt;  Zero GPIO glitches.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Safe Quiescent:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• S0: IDLE is safe&lt;br/&gt;  baseline state.&lt;br/&gt;• Dual loops (E6, E7)&lt;br/&gt;  guarantee bounded&lt;br/&gt;  return to S0 without&lt;br/&gt;  microcontroller reset." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
