                <mxCell id="proof_box" value="&lt;b&gt;Liu &amp;amp; Layland (1973) RMS Schedulability Proof:&lt;/b&gt; Total Utilisation U = Σ (Ci / Ti) = 15/50 + 10/200 + 25/500 + 40/1000 = 0.300 + 0.050 + 0.050 + 0.040 = &lt;b&gt;0.440 &amp;lt;= U_bound = 0.757&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Worst-Case Response Times:&lt;/b&gt; WCRT(τ1)=15ms &amp;lt; 50ms | WCRT(τ2)=25ms &amp;lt; 200ms | WCRT(τ3)=50ms &amp;lt; 500ms | WCRT(τ4)=120ms &amp;lt; 1000ms (All Deadlines Met)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=9.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
